                    <msContents>
                        <summary/>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i1">
                            <locus from="7v" to="242v"/>
                            <title>Pentaglot Glossary: Gǝʿǝz — Amharic — Tigrinya — Tigre — Swedish</title>
                            <note>According to <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/N6HPGQK3"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue"/><title level="m">Catalogue des manuscrits éthiopiens de l’Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei: Fonds Conti Rossini et Fonds Caetani 209, 375, 376, 377, 378</title><title level="s">Indici e Sussidi Bibliografici della Biblioteca</title><author><forename>Stefan</forename><surname>Strelcyn</surname></author><pubPlace>Roma</pubPlace><publisher>Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei</publisher><date>1976</date><series><title level="s">Indici e Sussidi Bibliografici della Biblioteca</title><biblScope unit="volume">9</biblScope></series><biblScope unit="volume">9</biblScope><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:IHABook182</note><note type="tag">bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue</note></note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:IHABook182</note><note type="tag">bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue</note><citedRange unit="page">50</citedRange><citedRange unit="page">147</citedRange></bibl>, the Amharic column and the introduction are identical to
                                <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/24X7922B"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Tayya1889Sawasew"/><title level="m">መጽሐፈ፡ ሰዋስው፡ (Maṣḥafa sawāsǝw, ‘The book of grammar’)</title><author><name>Tāyya Gabra Māryām, &lt;i&gt;ʾAlaqā&lt;/i&gt;</name></author><pubPlace>Mǝnkullo</pubPlace><date>1896</date><note type="tags"><note type="tag">bm:Tayya1889Sawasew</note></note><note type="tag">bm:Tayya1889Sawasew</note><citedRange unit="chapter">3</citedRange></bibl> and do contain 
                                also cross-refernences. Therefore the text probably represents the original version of the printed edition. Both the Amharic
                                and the Gǝʿǝz as well as possibly the Tigrinya columns can therefore be assumed to come from the hand of
                                <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS9347TayyaGa"><roleName type="title">ʾAlaqa</roleName> Tāyya</persName>.</note>
                            <textLang mainLang="am" otherLangs="gez ti sv tig"/>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.1">
                                <locus from="7v"/>
                                <title>Amharic introduction</title>
                                <textLang mainLang="am"/>
                                <incipit xml:lang="am">ሶስተኛ፡ ታላቅ፡ ክፍል፡ ነጠላ፡ ግሥና፡ ዘርና፡ ነባር። ነጠላ፡ ግሥ፡ ዘርና፡ ነባር፡ ምን፡ እንደሆኑ፡ በመቅድሙ፡ በገጽ፡ ፬ ሶስተኛውን፡
                                    ክፍል፡ እይ። ሞክሽ፡ ያላቸው፡ ግሦች፡ ባራት፡ ክፍል፡ ይከፈላሉ።</incipit> 
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="ms_i1.2">
                                <locus from="8v" to="242v"/>
                                <title>Pentaglot Glossary</title>
                                <note>Gǝʿǝz and Amharic are written in the same hand and with the same pen, possibly that of 
                                    <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS9347TayyaGa"><roleName type="title">ʾAlaqa</roleName> Tāyya</persName>.
                                    The Gǝʿǝz and Amharic verbs are placed in the left and middle columns of the 
                                    verso pages, while the Tigrinya verbs were added in the right column, probably by Tāyya but with another pen. 
                                    The Tigre and Swedish equivalents, however, are written by another, European hand in the left and right columns of 
                                    the recto pages vis-à-vis the Gǝʿǝz — Amharic — Tigrinya polyglot glossary. Interlinear corrections on the Amharic 
                                    part may have been added by the author after the experience of printing the first and second chapters of the Sawāsǝw
                                    were printed. The last eleven lemmata from 
                                    <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/24X7922B"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Tayya1889Sawasew"/><title level="m">መጽሐፈ፡ ሰዋስው፡ (Maṣḥafa sawāsǝw, ‘The book of grammar’)</title><author><name>Tāyya Gabra Māryām, &lt;i&gt;ʾAlaqā&lt;/i&gt;</name></author><pubPlace>Mǝnkullo</pubPlace><date>1896</date><note type="tags"><note type="tag">bm:Tayya1889Sawasew</note></note><note type="tag">bm:Tayya1889Sawasew</note><citedRange unit="page">189</citedRange></bibl>
                                    are missing because the last folium is lost. The Tigre vocabulary was apparently not used in 
                                    <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/IF3JCC54"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:LittmannHofner1962Tigre"/><title level="m">Wörterbuch der Tigrē-Sprache: Tigrē–Deutsch–Englisch</title><title level="s">Akademie der Wissenschaften und der Literatur, Veröffentlichungen der Orientalischen Kommission</title><author><forename>Enno</forename><surname>Littmann</surname></author><author><forename>Maria</forename><surname>Höfner</surname></author><pubPlace>Wiesbaden</pubPlace><publisher>Franz Steiner Verlag</publisher><date>1962</date><series><title level="s">Akademie der Wissenschaften und der Literatur, Veröffentlichungen der Orientalischen Kommission</title><biblScope unit="volume">11</biblScope></series><biblScope unit="volume">11</biblScope><note type="url">https://opendata.uni-halle.de/explore?bitstream_id=cb5f5304-020f-4466-9d3b-1ebc7e300508&amp;handle=1981185920/103087&amp;provider=iiif-image</note><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Comparative dictionary</note><note type="tag">Dictionaries</note><note type="tag">Tigre</note><note type="tag">bm:LittmannHofner1962Tigre</note></note><note type="tag">Comparative dictionary</note><note type="tag">Dictionaries</note><note type="tag">Tigre</note><note type="tag">bm:LittmannHofner1962Tigre</note></bibl>.</note>
                                <textLang mainLang="am" otherLangs="gez ti sv tig"/>
                                <explicit xml:lang="tig"><supplied resp="PRS8999Strelcyn" reason="lost">ኩፕ፡ አ</supplied>ፍንጫ።
                                    <gap reason="lost"/></explicit>   
                            </msItem>
                        </msItem>
